description:
Primal Allianceis pleased to offer this modern studioin Peninsula Two, a premium residential tower in Business Bay, developed by Select Group. As part of the master-planned Peninsula project, it offers stylish, efficient living with stunning views of the Dubai Canal, city skyline, and Persian Gulf. 

 UNIT KEY FEATURES: 



 - Studio in the best location of Business Bay 
- High floor 
- Canal and park view 
- Size 37,90 sqm 
- Have payment plan 70% now 30% on handover



 AMENITIES: 

 - 205 m2 gym equipped with professional sports equipment;
- large lobby with a restaurant, caf and comfortable sitting areas;
- outdoor swimming pool with an area of 205 m2 and a depth of 1.2 m;
- multifunctional hall for events;
- play area for kids;
- basketball, squash and tennis courts;
- skateboarding park;
- chargers for electric vehicles;
- car and bicycle parking;
- footpaths 

 Additionally, the building will have 24/7 security and video surveillance, along with a fire alarm system, centralized air conditioning, and an audio intercom in the lobby. 

 LOCATION: 

 Peninsula Two's prime location near Dubai Water Canal, Al Khail Road, and Sheikh Road ensures seamless access to both land and marine transport. Bus stops like The Binary Tower and Clover Bay Tower 1 are within a 10-minute walk, while metro and marine stations, including Business Bay Metro and Marasi Marine Transport, are about 30 minutes away. 

 Residents can reach supermarkets, banks, medical centers, and schools within 15-20 minutes. For healthcare needs, facilities such as EK Clinic SZC, Emirates Hospital Clinic, and The Physio Center offer comprehensive medical services.

Safa Two by DAMAC | 1BR | High Floor | Sea View. 

Experience luxury living in Safa Two by DAMAC, an architectural masterpiece designed by de Grisogono.
This 1-bedroom apartment is located on a high floor and offers stunning sea and skyline views through floor-to-ceiling windows.

Property Details:
Size: 803 sq.ft;
1 Bedroom |  2 Bathroom
High Floor | Sea View

Features:
Spacious Balcony;
Fully Fitted Kitchen;
Smart Home System;
Modern Finishes.

 Amenities:
Infinity Pool with Skyline and Sea Views;
Luxury Spa and Gym;
Sky Garden and Rooftop Lounge;
Concierge and 24/7 Security;
Retail and Dining Options.

 Prime Location:
Direct access to Sheikh Zayed Road;
5 mins to Downtown Dubai;
10 mins to Jumeirah Beach;
Close to Business Bay and DIFC.
